1
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:28,719
Two birds with one stone.

2
00:02:31,039 --> 00:02:32,439
You used the ghost rumors

3
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,639
to abolish Lin Wanmei's overtime policy.

4
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:37,000
It undermined her authority,

5
00:02:37,199 --> 00:02:39,120
drove a wedge between her and Xiaoxiao,

6
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,680
and won over the R&D Department.

7
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,039
Isn't that two birds with one stone?

8
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,639
What are you going to do about it?

9
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,080
I'm not going to do anything.

10
00:02:50,439 --> 00:02:51,479
But I know

11
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,159
your true motive

12
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,199
isn't just about Chu Yan, is it?

13
00:03:01,199 --> 00:03:02,000
Tell me.

14
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,520
I might be able to help you.

15
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:05,639
This is my own business.

16
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,039
Stay out of it.

17
00:03:09,639 --> 00:03:11,080
I am the company's CEO.

18
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,560
I have the right to know everything that happens here.

19
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:17,000
What if

20
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:20,159
it severely impacts the company?

21
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,520
Whatever the impact,

22
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,080
I'll handle it myself.

23
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:26,520
CEO An,

24
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:29,439
save that speech for the shareholders.

25
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:30,879
Don't waste it on me.

26
00:03:34,319 --> 00:03:35,240
You really want to know?

27
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,960
Well, I'm not telling you.

28
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:56,080
You knew she was targeting Lin Wanmei,

29
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,120
yet you didn't stop her.

30
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,280
There must be more to Chu Yan's suicide.

31
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:01,520
Sang Luo isn't the only one who wants to know.

32
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:02,520
I want to know too.

33
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,319
So you plan to keep indulging Sang Luo?

34
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:06,319
Aren't you afraid she'll blow things out of proportion?

35
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,199
A vibrant life was lost.

36
00:04:12,159 --> 00:04:13,439
Everyone who pushed her to her death

37
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,520
must pay the price.

38
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:25,160
You scared me.

39
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,399
What are you doing here?

40
00:04:26,959 --> 00:04:28,399
I should be asking you that.

41
00:04:28,879 --> 00:04:30,439
Since when do you have this hobby

42
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,720
