43
00:04:34,639 --> 00:04:37,000
I've just been so busy with work lately.

44
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,759
I need to exercise more

45
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,319
to maintain my muscles.

46
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,639
You're lying.

47
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,279
When have I ever lied to you?

48
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:45,680
We had a deal.

49
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:47,160
We'd take down Lin Wanmei together,

50
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,480
and then you'd promote me.

51
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,959
But Sang Luo is still here.

52
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:51,079
She's just a bitch.

53
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:52,680
It doesn't matter what she is.

54
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,680
She still holds the title

55
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,639
of Genius Winemaker.

56
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,040
I can't just casually

57
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,279
put you in the Director position.

58
00:04:58,639 --> 00:05:00,160
I'm leading a company,

59
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,040
an entire group.

60
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,000
I have to convince everyone,

61
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,720
right?

62
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,759
Well, you're the leader.

63
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,839
You pretty much have the final say.

64
00:05:06,839 --> 00:05:08,360
Come up with something for me.

65
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,120
Lately,

66
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,279
I have been thinking of a way for you.

67
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,120
Go apologize to Lin Wanmei.

68
00:05:14,199 --> 00:05:14,959
Give her a way out.

69
00:05:14,959 --> 00:05:16,519
I'm sick of her.

70
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,480
No way.

71
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,040
As for a solution,

72
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,160
I already gave you one.

73
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:20,879
You should

74
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:22,439
think it over yourself.

75
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,439
You got what you wanted and now you're ditching me?

76
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:28,839
Are you even a man?

77
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:29,439
Pfft!

78
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,759
Pfft, pfft, pfft!

79
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,079
If that's how you're going to be,

80
00:05:33,079 --> 00:05:34,600
then I can't help you at all.

81
00:05:35,199 --> 00:05:36,480
You're on your own.

82
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,399
Fine.

83
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,680
If that's the case,

84
00:05:38,959 --> 00:05:40,120
I'll just have to give this

85
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,279
