92
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:07,639
Baby,

93
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,079
if you'd told me you had this earlier,

94
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,639
wouldn't we have

95
00:06:11,639 --> 00:06:13,279
taken down Lin Wanmei a long time ago?

96
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,160
Did you come back for me

97
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,639
