99
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,680
You're the most important person to me.

100
00:06:20,959 --> 00:06:22,160
How could I not help you?

101
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:25,040
That's more like it.

102
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,079
Listen to me,

103
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,120
this is the key evidence

104
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,959
that Lin Wanmei drove Chu Yan to her death.

105
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:32,000
Contact your media friends.

106
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:34,519
We need to blow this up as big as possible

107
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:36,720
