Step back.

121
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,399
You can't hide.

122
00:07:23,439 --> 00:07:24,120
Yanyan.

123
00:07:24,639 --> 00:07:25,439
Will Yanyan's humiliation

124
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,800
