131
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,639
to drink and sexually assaulting them.

132
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,639
Major twist in Valley Breeze Group scandal.

133
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:55,360
The real mastermind is someone else.

134
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,600
Cut the crap.

135
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,439
Five million.

136
00:07:58,759 --> 00:07:59,800
Once I step out of Valley Breeze Group,

137
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:02,240
I won't say a word about your dirty deeds.

138
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,279
It's so late.

139
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:12,000
What do you want?

140
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:12,759
Cheng Yan.

141
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,360
Help me intercept a news story.

142
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,879
Someone is inciting a cybermob against me.

143
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:17,800
I know.

144
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:18,720
I know.

145
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,360
I bought those internet trolls just for you.

146
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:23,319
They're pretty good at steering the narrative, right?

147
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,600
It was you.

148
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,040
Why?

149
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,240
Why would you do this to me?

150
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,040
Cheng Yan!

151
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:32,320
Someone with no use to me...

152
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,440
