153
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,120
You...

154
00:08:40,399 --> 00:08:42,000
Such a nice girl.

155
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:45,080
I really hate to see you go.

156
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,279
What a pity.

157
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:53,240
You used the Public Relations Department

158
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,639
to steer public opinion

159
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:57,440
and pin everything on Xiaoxiao.

160
00:08:58,879 --> 00:08:59,679
Sister-in-law.

161
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:01,639
My show of sincerity...

162
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,960
It's not bad, right?

163
00:09:05,399 --> 00:09:06,200
She

164
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,720
is just an insignificant nobody.

165
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:11,240
If you can handle Mom for me,

166
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,559
then that will prove

167
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:14,799
you have what it takes to work with me.

168
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,840
Oh, Sister-in-law...

169
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:20,559
you really are a bit too greedy.

170
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:22,840
If you can't even handle this,

171
00:09:23,279 --> 00:09:24,720
then there's nothing more to say.

172
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,919
As long as you're willing to take my side

173
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,279
and help take Cheng An down,

174
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:40,679
handling Mom

175
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,679
is just a matter of a few words.

176
00:09:43,559 --> 00:09:45,320
You know where I stand with Mom.

177
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,120
It's just that...

178
00:09:47,879 --> 00:09:49,399
I'm afraid you might hold back.

179
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,080
After all, you and the third brother

180
00:09:51,759 --> 00:09:53,200
had a history together.

181
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,960
Let me give you a piece of advice, Cheng Yan.

182
00:09:58,879 --> 00:10:00,440
If you really want to work with me,

183
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:02,799
you'd better not cross the line.

184
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,879
You backstabbing, manipulative bitch!

185
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,399
Hope you get hit by a car!

186
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,000
When you look in the mirror,

187
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,039
doesn't your vicious face make you sick?

188
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,720
Go to hell! Die!

189
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:22,399
It's not my fault!

190
00:10:23,399 --> 00:10:24,519
It's not my fault!

191
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:26,480
It's not!

192
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,559
Someone's trying to kill me!

193
00:10:30,879 --> 00:10:32,159
Someone's trying to kill me!

194
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,639
Murder!

195
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,399
Open the door!

196
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:39,480
Do you have a phone?

197
00:10:39,519 --> 00:10:40,480
Do you have a phone?

198
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:41,919
Hello?

199
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,159
Is this the police?

200
00:10:43,159 --> 00:10:43,840
What are you doing?

201
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:44,799
I want to turn myself in!

202
00:10:44,799 --> 00:10:46,039
I need to turn myself in right now!

203
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,320
The people who assaulted Chu Yan

204
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:53,000
and Xiaoxiao are already in prison.

205
00:10:53,639 --> 00:10:55,200
But Lin Wanmei still got away.

206
00:10:57,279 --> 00:10:58,919
Actually, I should have known

207
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:02,279
