208
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:04,039
I've already had my people look into it.

209
00:11:04,759 --> 00:11:06,679
It was Xiaoxiao who leaked the news to Cheng Yan.

210
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,639
But Cheng Yan switched sides at the last minute

211
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,399
and helped Lin Wanmei in the end.

212
00:11:11,559 --> 00:11:13,320
It looks like they've joined forces.

213
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,039
I wonder who their gun

214
00:11:17,039 --> 00:11:18,519
will be aimed at next.

215
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:47,799
Auntie.

216
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,320
I'm so sorry.

217
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,639
I failed Chu Yan.

218
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:55,039
I was such a coward.

219
00:11:55,039 --> 00:11:57,480
I didn't step up to help her in time.

220
00:11:59,519 --> 00:12:00,600
This is Chu Yan's diary,

221
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,399
and her favorite sunshine doll.

222
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,960
These are all my favorites.

223
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:18,840
Yanyan.

224
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:21,240
You need to listen to your boss at work.

225
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:23,399
That way, they will like you.

226
00:12:25,799 --> 00:12:26,600
Director Lin.

227
00:12:26,919 --> 00:12:28,200
My mom brewed this herself.

228
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,279
Longan and red ginseng paste.

229
00:12:29,639 --> 00:12:31,360
It has no weird additives.

230
00:12:31,559 --> 00:12:32,559
For cold hands and feet,

231
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:33,600
it works wonders.

232
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,360
Give it a try.

233
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,960
Thank your mom for me.

234
00:12:37,799 --> 00:12:39,000
Everyone, have a taste.

235
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,600
These are cupcakes my mom made.

236
00:12:40,919 --> 00:12:41,960
They're delicious. Thanks.

237
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,080
Smells so good.

238
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:45,399
Smells great. Thanks.

239
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,200
You're welcome.

240
00:12:46,759 --> 00:12:47,559
Supervisor Xiao.

241
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,080
Who knows if they're even clean,

242
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,320
handing them out like this.

243
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,399
This... This...

244
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,759
Alright.

245
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,000
Let's go.

246
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,320
It's all my fault.

247
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:24,279
I thought kindness begets kindness,

248
00:13:25,159 --> 00:13:27,240
but I ended up harming her instead.

249
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:28,679
Auntie.

250
00:13:30,559 --> 00:13:32,240
I deserve to die.

251
00:13:32,639 --> 00:13:34,279
It's all my fault.

252
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:35,879
Yanyan!

253
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,399
Yanyan!

254
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,879
Chu Yan

255
00:13:42,879 --> 00:13:44,480
was part of the R&D Department.

256
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,960
As the head of the R&D Department,

257
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,039
Lin Wanmei,

258
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,879
do you have anything to say?

259
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:54,399
Um,

260
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:57,279
I must say a few words for Director Lin.

261
00:13:57,639 --> 00:13:58,600
Everyone knows

262
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,799
that Director Lin is pregnant.

263
00:13:59,919 --> 00:14:02,159
She's been running around for this matter

264
00:14:02,159 --> 00:14:03,600
to clarify the truth.

265
00:14:03,759 --> 00:14:04,559
I think

266
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,279
she has done her duty.

267
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,480
Who told her to go?

268
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:10,559
She brought so much shame to the Cheng family.

269
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,559
How does she even have the nerve to go out

270
00:14:12,679 --> 00:14:14,080
and show her face in public?

271
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:15,879
At the end of the day,

272
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,960
the Public Relations Department got the news

273
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,039
and decided to handle it passively.

274
00:14:19,799 --> 00:14:21,159
If we had received the news earlier

275
00:14:21,159 --> 00:14:22,039
and faced it actively,

276
00:14:22,039 --> 00:14:23,720
things wouldn't have turned out like this.

277
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:29,399
Cheng An,

278
00:14:29,759 --> 00:14:31,120
as the CEO of the company,

279
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:33,000
with such a huge mess happening,

280
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,879
you can't escape the blame.

281
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,480
So please, CEO An,

282
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:38,440
take the fall and resign

283
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:40,399
